{"pageid": 1444, "title": "The Art of Something is Killing the Children", "revid": 2959, "categories": ["Comics", "Spinoffs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">The Art of Something is Killing the Children</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/9/9f/The_Art_of_Something_is_Killing_the_Children_Cover.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260329040751\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"The Art of Something is Killing the Children Cover\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/9/9f/The_Art_of_Something_is_Killing_the_Children_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20260329040751\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/9/9f/The_Art_of_Something_is_Killing_the_Children_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20260329040751 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/9/9f/The_Art_of_Something_is_Killing_the_Children_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20260329040751 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"The Art of Something is Killing the Children Cover\" width=\"270\" height=\"414\" data-image-key=\"The_Art_of_Something_is_Killing_the_Children_Cover.jpg\" data-image-name=\"The Art of Something is Killing the Children Cover.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"writer\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Written by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"illustration\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Illustrated by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"colors\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Colors by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Miquel Muerto</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"release_date\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Release date</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">December 10, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>The Art of Something is Killing the Children</b></i> is a comprehensive hardcover artbook celebrating five years of the <a href=\"/wiki/Slaughterverse\" title=\"Slaughterverse\">Slaughterverse</a>, featuring rare sketches, pages, and covers, all curated by series co-creator <a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a>. It was published on December 10, 2024, by <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</span></h2>\n<p>Since 2019, the world of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something is Killing the Children</a></i> has captivated comic fans everywhere, becoming a global phenomenon for the horror genre and setting a new standard for storytelling. With over 2,000,000 units sold along with numerous award recognitions, <i>Something Is Killing The Children</i> has birthed an entire Slaughterverse with its own unique visual language. Fans can take a closer look than ever at the bloody, moody, and soul-changing details of artist <a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a>'s amazing and often homaged art, delving deep into the development process of this landmark series! This prestige, hardcover format artbook features rare sketches and a collection of pages and covers, all curated by Werther Dell’Edera, the series’ co-creator.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0fbd8161c38d636aa1e8c87c1fe4fa2d\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"The_Art_of_Something_is_Killing_the_Children_Cover-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:120px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:The_Art_of_Something_is_Killing_the_Children_Cover.jpg\" title=\"The Art of Something is Killing the Children Cover.jpg (70 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:120px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/9/9f/The_Art_of_Something_is_Killing_the_Children_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/120?cb=20260329040751\" title=\"The Art of Something is Killing the Children Cover.jpg (70 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"The Art of Something is Killing the Children Cover.jpg\" data-image-key=\"The_Art_of_Something_is_Killing_the_Children_Cover.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"The Art of Something is Killing the Children Cover.jpg (70 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"The Art of Something is Killing the Children Cover.jpg\" data-image-key=\"The_Art_of_Something_is_Killing_the_Children_Cover.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/9/9f/The_Art_of_Something_is_Killing_the_Children_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/120?cb=20260329040751\" /></a></div></div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<p><br />\n</p></div>", "fetched_at": "2026-10-28T22:43:47+00:00"}